10.08 diagnostic probe (executable): is the FUNCTION wrong or the TEST wrong?
==============================================================================
fixture passes args (2, 4); reference add(2, 4) = 6; test expects 5
-> even the reference implementation fails => the root cause is the fixture, not any candidate fix
with the corrected fixture (2, 3): reference gives 5 == 5 -> True

LESSON: five patches to the function could never pass; one probe on the reference located the cause.


